          The types of this music object; determines by what engraver
          this music expression is processed.


File: lilypond-internals.info,  Node: ChordSlurEvent,  Next: ClusterNoteEvent,  Prev: CaesuraEvent,  Up: Music expressions

1.1.20 ‘ChordSlurEvent’
-----------------------

Do not arpeggiate this chord.  This is similar to *Note
NonArpeggiatoEvent:: with the acknowledgment that performing all notes
simultaneously might be impossible.

   Syntax: NOTE‘-\chordSlur’

   Event classes: *note chord-slur-event::, *note music-event:: and
*note StreamEvent::.

   Accepted by: *note Arpeggio_engraver::.

   Properties:

     ‘name’ (symbol):
          ‘'ChordSlurEvent’

          Name of this music object.

     ‘types’ (list):
          '(post-event chord-slur-event event)

          The types of this music object; determines by what engraver
          this music expression is processed.


