1.1.126 ‘VoltaRepeatEndEvent’
-----------------------------

Signal the end of a volta-style repeat.  Multiple end events per start
event can be expected when there are alternative endings.

   Event classes: *note music-event::, *note StreamEvent::, *note
structural-event:: and *note volta-repeat-end-event::.

   Accepted by: *note Divisio_engraver::, *note
Lyric_repeat_count_engraver::, *note Repeat_acknowledge_engraver:: and
*note Signum_repetitionis_engraver::.

   Properties:

     ‘name’ (symbol):
          ‘'VoltaRepeatEndEvent’

          Name of this music object.

     ‘types’ (list):
          '(volta-repeat-end-event structural-event event)

          The types of this music object; determines by what engraver
          this music expression is processed.


File: lilypond-internals.info,  Node: VoltaRepeatStartEvent,  Next: VoltaRepeatedMusic,  Prev: VoltaRepeatEndEvent,  Up: Music expressions

