   Context ‘ChordGridScore’ can contain *note ChoirStaff::, *note
ChordGrid::, *note ChordNames::, *note Devnull::, *note DrumStaff::,
*note Dynamics::, *note FiguredBass::, *note FretBoards::, *note
GrandStaff::, *note GregorianTranscriptionLyrics::, *note
